            name:
                fields:
                    given: Walder
                    surname: Frey
                value: Walder Frey
            sex: male
            title:
                - value: Lord of the Crossing
        notes: Patriarch of House Frey, Lord of the Crossing. ASOS appendix lists him extensively with his eight wives and numerous children. Orchestrated the Red Wedding — the massacre of Robb Stark, Catelyn Stark, and their bannermen at the wedding of Edmure Tully and Roslin Frey.
